    {
      "reviewId": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210Mk1HRkpTRGxmWTFOTFkzSjBZVGMyUW1WVFFVRRAB",
      "authorName": "Basile J. Valentin",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "9 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 187 reviews · 126 photos",
      "text": "Kawagarbo peak (6740 meters / 22110 feet high) is a mesmerising snow mountain of the Meilixueshan range, a fierce natural border of Tibet, with Mekong river flowing along down there. As it's quite far from the city of Shangri-la/Gyaitang, and as the landscape deserves more admiration and exploration, i suggest staying around Feilasi or Shengpinzhen. Target as well a good weather window, not to be disappointed of not seeing snowy peaks in case of cloudy day. Starting point of Yubeng trek",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:44:45.500Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUREaTdMclBnEAE",
      "authorName": "Tuyet Mai Dinh Thi",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "a year ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 509 reviews · 1,345 photos",
      "text": "Absolutely amazing beauty of nature with the incredible golden sunrise shining upon the dramatic snow-capped peaks. The Meili Snow Mountain is located about 10 kilometers northeast of Deqin County, Diqing Tibetan Autonomous Prefecture of Yunnan Province. Among all the 13 peaks, Kawagebo is the highest peak, which is 6,740 meters above sea level, being reputed as the most beautiful mountain in the world. The area is a holy land of pilgrimage for Tibetan Buddhists.",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:44:45.501Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25SaFNGVndSbEJxWlZadGRDMUlWVlpZY25sVVoyYxAB",
      "authorName": "Ki Wi",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "9 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 15 reviews · 46 photos",
      "text": "Best thing to wake up early to watch sunrise at mieli snow mountain with my fav people ♥️",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:44:45.501Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOcVNWa3dPRVpHZVZwRWVubGpiRTl6WTFKbVRWRRAB",
      "authorName": "古川",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "a week ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 238 reviews · 913 photos",
      "text": "This mountain is deeply revered as a holy site in Tibetan Buddhism. Tragically, many lives were lost during past Sino-Japanese expeditions attempting to climb it. Today, climbing is strictly forbidden out of respect for local beliefs and to honor those who perished. It’s perfect to admire its grandeur from a distance—its beauty and sanctity are best experienced without trying to conquer it.",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:45:47.606Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xodFFVZE5ZbEZtUkZwWlprUnVSVFU1YVZCT1MwRRAB",
      "authorName": "Hongda Xu",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "7 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 19 reviews · 58 photos",
      "text": "Meili Snow Mountain (Prince Snow Mountain/Prince Thirteen Peaks) is a deeply mysterious place, with its main peak still unreached. This is a sacred mountain. May everyone enjoy its beauty without angering the mountain deity!",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:45:47.606Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNsNjhUVW9nRRAB",
      "authorName": "feifei feifei",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "2 years ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 13 reviews · 65 photos",
      "text": "There's a good chance of seeing the Golden Mountain in the sun in late November or early December. Feilai Temple offers free admission, allowing you to see all eight peaks and get closer to the snow-capped mountains. However, hotel accommodations are quite expensive. Hotels in Deqin County are inexpensive, but meals are more expensive.",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T09:46:49.954Z"
    },
